WEBVTT

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:05.020
Do I really have to say it?

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:10.910
When you come out and ask 
me what I like about him...

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:13.160
It's kind of embarrassing.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.900
Give it up. We all promised to share
 with each other, right?

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.260
It was a pajama party promise.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.410
I have a feeling this'll be exciting!

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.080
We all have to go in order, then, okay?

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.290
Ahem.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:32.160
Well, he's lived close to me
 ever since I was little,

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.930
and he's always poked and prodded at me.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:39.680
But it reminds me of a cat wanting to play.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.510
It's really cute.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:45.680
Well, I like that he's huge!

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.220
I'll never forget the strong, 
ripped body he had when we first met!

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.320
I love it!

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:53.950
How bold.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:58.450
But I couldn't take my eyes off him.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:03.230
The contrast of his kind, 
gentle, enlightened eyes

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.210
and his wild strength is just wonderful.

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.710
Everyone has her own preferences, huh?

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:12.460
By the way, I love how mysterious he is.

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:15.110
They're just so wonderful, aren't they?

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:19.400
Pomurun!

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:19.470
Moomf

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.620
Dragons!

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:21.830
Horned gorillas!

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:23.270
Wacky seaweed!

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.850
Yusha-san...

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.730
Since pomurun are the weakest of monsters, 
you might not have realized it,

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:33.010
but you were just being attacked by it.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:33.770
Huh?!

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:36.200
You mean it wasn't inviting me to play?

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:39.310
Sei-chan, you like horned gorillas?

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:43.220
Even I couldn't eat the sages of the forest.

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:45.330
I didn't mean it in that way!

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:48.700
Wait, you mean you would eat a dragon?!

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:51.210
Also, Mei! What is a wacky seaweed?!

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:55.930
It's a local monster from my hometown 
that dances every night

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.220
while praying for good harvests.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.970
What's that all about, anyway?

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.470
Don't ask me.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:08.180
So, that now we're done discussing our 
favorite monsters, what's our next fun topic?

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:13.480
How about... "I hate it when the 
Demon Lord's four generals are like this!"

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.740
Oh!

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.140
Nice choice, Yusha-san.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.220
That's a good one!

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.990
Okay, I'll go first!

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.800
Endro!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.000
<i>I'm Yulia Chardiet!</i>

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.080
<i>Everyone calls me Yusha!</i>

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.960
<i>I'm studying at an adventurer 
school to become a Hero!</i>

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:02.090
<i>My friends Seira-chan, Fai-chan, and Mei-chan
 went through a practical lesson with me,</i>

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:05.120
<i>and somehow we discovered the Hero's sword!</i>

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:09.860
<i>Then, after I drew the Hero's sword...</i>

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.640
Adventurer School

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:13.960
I really became a Hero.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.730
Yusha the Hero!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.230
Just kidding.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.620
The Hero now sleeps.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:34.190
That was a play on Yu-chan sleeping here 
and the death of a Hero, wasn't it, Mei-chan?

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:37.130
You actually say some smart 
things now and then, Fai.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:41.350
This girl is Mao-chan.

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:46.590
She's tiny, but she's the teacher in charge 
of our class at the adventurer school.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.760
Would you just wake up already?

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.080
Wha... Wh-What?!

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:54.490
Sheesh. What a skilled sleep-talker you are.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:55.900
I'm sorry.

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:59.530
We were all up a little late last night.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.900
It was a pajama party,

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:05.280
fit for a party of adventurers! Get it?!

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:06.980
I see. I see.

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.780
Glad to hear you're having fun.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.420
Yeah, we had a whole lot of fun!

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:13.230
The funnest was the topic of

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:17.300
"How would you handle a Demon Lord
 if they surrendered?"

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:20.050
Yusha-san's answer was the best!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:21.020
Wait!

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.050
I'm bit curious about that topic.

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:25.610
Ahem!

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:27.780
Y-You, Class President.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:30.430
Um, what do mean by "Class President"?

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:33.560
Well, you have the look of a class president.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:35.060
The look?

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.810
Besides, you elves take the stance of,

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:41.440
"You vulgar, inferior races shall obey
 our beautiful and noble kind!"

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:43.380
Don't you?

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:46.950
Please refrain from saying things 
that misrepresent whole races!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.510
Mao-chan-sensei, you're amazing!

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:52.240
You really look the part when 
you condescend like that!

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:55.850
We're picking up from where 
we were interrupted.

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:57.180
Now, Class President,

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.850
explain the Demon Lord and the Hero.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.000
All right.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:07.620
Several millennia ago, a living 
calamity appeared on Naral Island.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:12.580
This calamity was the first Demon Lord
 ever recorded in history.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:15.790
At the same time, one capable 
of opposing the Demon Lord,

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.330
the first Hero, was also born.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:21.690
After a fierce battle between the two, 
the Hero defeated the Demon Lord.

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:24.280
However, after a some time had passed,

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.480
a Demon Lord appeared once again.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:30.740
But a new Hero appeared 
elsewhere, as well,

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:33.040
and challenged the Demon Lord to battle.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.480
Once again, the Demon Lord was defeated.

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.060
That cycle has continued to repeat,

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:43.720
and before we knew it,
 we'd come to our 999th Hero.

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:45.670
Was that good?

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.120
Yes, that was good.

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.740
You little...

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.670
Classroom learning is important,

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:59.620
but what you adventurers
really need is strength.

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.130
Come on, get it together!

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.130
Damn! She's quick!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.190
My attacks aren't connecting!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:08.580
Draptors are monsters known for their agility.

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:10.790
You'll never hit one just by swinging wild—

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.410
I'll end you!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.560
See-Lots-Of-Punches Punch!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.490
She's good!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:27.930
The force of Cartado users is dependent 
on their magic power and skill.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:33.130
Even low-ranked cards can match up to 
high-ranked cards depending on how you use—

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:39.470
Yes, by combining low-level Cartado like this,

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:43.170
you can multiply their force 
and use them effectively.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.140
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:50.150
When it comes to Cartado,
 I get so excited, it's obvious to anyone.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.840
How so?!

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:55.890
A treasure chest is an
adventurer's greatest reward.

00:07:55.890 --> 00:08:00.060
But this means they come with lots of traps, 
so it can cost your life if you're not careful.

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:01.940
It bit me!

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:06.630
Yay, a treasure chest!

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:07.750
She's...

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.200
One here, too, and one here!

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.510
So many of them!

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:17.260
She's easily surpassing the 
1% chance of avoiding a trap?!

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:20.870
Mao-chan!

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:21.820
Sensei!

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:22.280
Mao-chan-sensei!

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.650
Mao-sensei!

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:26.190
Goodbye!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.400
Be careful on your way home.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:30.280
Okay!

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:33.750
Sheesh, what energetic girls.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:34.950
Mao-sensei.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.910
How about a drink on the way home?

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:40.940
Oh? That sounds nice.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:48.700
You've really captured the hearts of 
your students, haven't you, Mao-sensei?

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:52.170
No, no, I'm still very new at this.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.720
You're just being modest.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:59.460
<i>By the way, are there any promising 
individuals this time around?</i>

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:02.680
You're too cute. I may hug you?

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.160
You're getting your pretense
 and true desires backwards, lush.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.510
Hmm... Promising students, huh?

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:15.700
The head of the class, Ellenoar Seiran,
 has great knowledge.

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:18.650
There's also Fai Fai,
 who's gifted with combat strength,

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:22.040
and Mather Enderstto, who's blessed 
with a talent for Cartado.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:25.920
Then there's Yulia Chardiet's 
luck and unpredictability.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:29.540
All of them will eventually 
become respectable adventurers.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.460
That's impressive.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.300
Maybe they'll even be able 
to defeat the Demon Lord.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:38.300
True, those four could potentially do it.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:46.200
Wait, why?!

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:49.240
Why am I getting so serious 
about teaching their class?!

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:52.470
<i>I'm</i> the Demon Lord, damn it!

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:57.610
It's too soon for a minor like you 
to enjoy this Choice Demon Lord.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.610
Choice Demon Lord 
This legendary liquor is brewed in the far west.
It takes its name from the demon who seduced
 an angel and brought liquor to the demon realm.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:00.740
Here, have a refill of orange juice.

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:06.300
Scheming against me?
 I'm impressed, Hero's party.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:09.900
In that case, I'll crush you all for real!

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.970
A quest?!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:13.760
Yes.

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:19.010
A true adventurer accepts various quests 
and earns both honor and rewards.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:23.140
As part of your studies,
 you all will accept a quest, as well.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.010
A quest!

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:27.500
It's as if we're real adventurers!

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:30.340
No, we <i>are</i> real adventurers.

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:32.300
I'm interested in this too, though.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:35.150
Oh! I want something delicious as my reward!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.620
I'm going to request something 
related to Cartado.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:40.660
Request! Quest! Get it?!

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:45.660
Now, you'll need to combine your strengths 
as a party in order to clear any quest.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:50.290
It's imperative that each party has a 
leader who can coordinate their strengths.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.920
So I'll be having you all choose 
an official party leader.

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:57.550
Me! I'll do my best as both Hero and leader!

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:01.180
I'll take responsibility for 
keeping these girls together.

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:04.420
Yeah, leave it to me, the King of the Forest!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:07.680
My Cartado shall guide all that we do.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.690
Huh?

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:16.400
<i>ENDRO!</i>

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:21.070
That surprised me.

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.830
I thought I was our leader.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.020
Well, what do we do?

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:30.900
<i>Frankly...</i>

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:34.270
<i>Since I thought I was our 
leader up until now...</i>

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.820
<i>Saying I'll be the leader now...</i>

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.720
<i>...is super difficult.</i>

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.300
I suppose our Hero should be 
the leader, shouldn't she?

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.600
Huh? Me?!

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:49.850
But your motherly nature makes 
you fit to be a leader, Seira-san.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.920
Who're you calling a mother?!

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.920
No, be confident in yourself!

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:56.900
You're a great mother to us all, Sei-chan!

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.360
Though your breasts are small.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.050
Though your breasts are small!

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:02.360
Why did you say that twice?!

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:05.600
Hey, why did you say that twice?!

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:07.100
<i>Stare...</i>

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.730
Wait, I know!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.080
Why don't we just make Chibi-chan our leader?

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.870
She's cute!

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:17.520
What are you even saying?

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.840
I see. She has a point.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:20.650
Huh?

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:23.340
Cute <i>does</i> win, after all.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.420
Huh?!

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:29.720
Uh, can we at least choose a 
bipedal race to be our leader?

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:30.930
D'oh!

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.450
Huh? Yusha?!

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:34.810
D-Did what I said upset you that much?!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.940
Seira-san, look.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.690
Huh? Wh-What?

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:46.950
Chibi, are you trying to stand on two legs?

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:50.580
Chibi-chan, you can do it.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:52.830
Do your best.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:55.960
Just a little more! Just a little more!

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.540
Oh, I can't watch!

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:04.840
You can't look away. We must 
witness every moment of this!

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:08.010
You're right.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:09.350
Stand.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:10.720
Stand.

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:11.980
Stand!

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:14.350
Stand, Chibi-chan!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:22.280
She did it!

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.890
So, after making such a fuss at night,

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:32.860
you spent all night on your knees 
getting lectured by the dorm mother.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.290
But thanks to that, we've chosen our leader.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:41.470
See? This is our leader, Chibi-chan!

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.010
No, that doesn't work.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:45.950
D'oh!

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.940
Don't look at me as though
 I said something surprising.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.760
You put me on the spot.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:56.820
Anyway, you need to choose your leader soon.

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:57.760
Got it?

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.950
I thought she was the perfect one for the job.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.400
I don't understand it.

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.190
No, we all got caught up in the flow,

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:08.780
but it really isn't right 
to make her our leader.

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.100
Oh! Then...

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.770
Why don't we take turns being leader?

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:19.390
I get it. We'll test to see
 who's the best at leading us all.

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:21.420
Sounds fun! I'm in!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.620
That might be the fastest solution.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.050
Then that's settled!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.840
<i>I know this well from past experience.</i>

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:34.180
<i>Fundamentally, you all are too free-spirited!</i>

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.280
<i>If you try to force a group together,</i>

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:39.840
<i>you'll only splinter it and 
cause your party to disband!</i>

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:44.690
<i>That is when I will once again 
rise as the Demon Lord!</i>

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:51.740
There goes Mao-sensei 
laughing into a cough again!

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.950
Leader Test Run 
Yusha

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.710
Searching for items is the most basic
 of basics for an adventurer!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.090
Wh-Who might you be?

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:05.650
The Hero!

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:06.780
Everyone, let's go!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:08.910
I bet there are items in this house!

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:11.470
Yeah...

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.120
I found medicinal herbs!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.870
Oh, a secret stash!

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:16.870
Bone-in meat!

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:20.000
I found risqué underwear!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:21.880
Sorry for the intrusion!

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.690
Yulia Chardiet 
Fail

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:29.200
Leader Test Run 
Seira

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:29.200
Now that I'm our leader,

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:32.380
you're all going to live orderly lives.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.330
Instead of just relying on the dorm mother,

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:37.260
we'll do the things we can for ourselves.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:37.950
Got it?

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:39.710
Yes!

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:43.210
All right, the first thing 
we'll do is make breakfast.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:46.970
Ow!

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.970
N-Next, we clean! We'll start with...

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:53.010
We start with the leader's room, right?

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:53.780
Hey! Wait!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:16:00.120
L-Listen... When you're 
researching lots of different things,

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:02.170
this just naturally....

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:09.580
Um... As our leader, I should help...

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:11.710
Have a seat, leader.

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:12.470
Okay.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.240
Ellenoar Seiran 
Fail by Lack of Femininity

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.870
Leader Test Run 
Fai

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.220
A leader needs to be strong, of course!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.310
So...

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:20.550
Here!

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:25.500
Wait, what does eating a lot 
have to do with strength?

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:29.200
It's a leader's job to bring 
everyone together, right?

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:32.300
But human relationships are tough,

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.560
so you need a strong stomach to handle it.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:38.090
The fact that you're surprisingly 
dead-on has left me speechless.

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:41.140
Seriously. She has common 
sense for the oddest things.

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:43.180
Well, time to dig in!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:47.960
All right! This is how a leader eats!

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:52.920
More!

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:54.490
Fai Fai 
Fail for Eating All of Their Food

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:56.120
Leader Test Run
Mei

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:59.300
As our leader, I want to strengthen
 our combat potential.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.060
So to that end...

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.240
We're all getting brand new Cartado

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:06.630
that are limited to one-per-person 
and hitting shelves tomorrow!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.980
So we're lining up here until morning!

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.140
Mather Enderstto 
Fail - All-Nighters Prohibited

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:27.060
<i>Oh? Not enough sleep, Mao-sensei?</i>

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:30.290
Your sleepy face is adorable. 
May I rub my cheeks against yours?

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.570
You got it backwards again!

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:35.140
Well, I'm struggling to keep up 
with following up on my students.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.960
Mao-chan!

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.960
Sensei.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.960
Mao-chan-sensei!

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.960
Mao-sensei.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:38.660
What's the fuss about?

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.460
We're sorry we caused trouble for you, Sensei.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:44.180
We've all reflected long 
and hard since then,

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:46.030
and we talked it over together.

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:47.920
And we've come to a conclusion.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:52.380
We don't think any of us 
is fit to be the leader.

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:55.050
Oh, you've realized that?

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:58.830
Well, there's more to life 
than being an adventurer.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:01.180
There are plenty of other 
ways to make a living.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.310
So we've taken a chance 
and made our decision.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.190
You're disbanding your party?!

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:09.690
We should just all be the leader!

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:10.960
Wait.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:13.650
I really don't understand this.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:17.320
If one leader can't bring 
our party together,

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.160
then all four of us will do it.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.480
Four times more, just like that!

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:23.040
Brute force in numbers is always stronger!

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:27.300
Uh, that's something the Demon Lord
 should be saying, not the Hero's party.

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:29.040
You said it yourself, Mao-chan.

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:33.150
We need to combine our strengths
 as a party in order to clear any quest.

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:34.240
So there you have it.

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:37.490
I'm the Hero leader!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.120
I-I'm the beautiful leader.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.370
I'm the wild leader!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.270
I'm the dark leader!

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:54.230
With four leaders together, 
our Hero's party is born!

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:57.700
That was a special effects Cartado!

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:02.330
H-H-H-How is that possible?!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:06.150
<i>I already knew this, didn't I?</i>

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:11.580
<i>The free spirits of these girls are 
uncontrollable to the very end.</i>

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:18.410
I applaud you for reaching me, Heroes.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:21.530
Out of respect for your bravery, 
I shall personally—

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:22.960
Hey, Yusha!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:25.290
Why are you leaping straight 
into the Demon Lord's room?!

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:30.540
We promised to ready ourselves, join hands,
 and enter after counting to three!

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.810
It's so big and roomy!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:33.840
Ow!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.360
Sorry. I broke a pillar.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.280
Oh! I knew it!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.360
There's a hidden door behind the throne!

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:44.120
Why are you all here?!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.040
Save it for later!

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:50.620
You've been dragging us around 
relentlessly ever since adventurer school!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:55.070
I love the fact that you always 
come along anyway, Seira-chan.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:56.480
Wha...

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:59.380
Where's this coming from?

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:03.600
I found a notebook full of poems 
in the room behind the hidden door.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:05.640
There was a mountain of snacks, too.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.080
Would you cut it out already?!

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:14.900
Enough!

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:17.460
This room shall be your grave,

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:20.070
and this world shall be mine!

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.610
In that case,

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:25.160
we'll use the forbidden magic 
that the sage of light taught us!

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:28.460
Right away?! Isn't that being too 
loose with forbidden magic?!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:31.340
Striking with maximum strength
 on your first move isn't a bad play.

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:32.700
If you defeat them, great.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.530
If you don't, you can still assess their level.

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:37.800
You're so hardcore, Fai-san.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:40.070
Everyone, let's go!

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:43.890
This power is...

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:47.630
O Holy Spirits filling the border
 between Heaven and Earth,

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:48.700
though we young—

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:52.080
Oh, sorry. I fumbled the incantation.

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:54.450
Hey!

00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:57.480
Huh?

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:05.930
What's going on here?!

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:09.840
<i>Huh?</i>

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.400
<i>That was where it all started.</i>

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:14.570
Later, Mao-chan!

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:18.750
<i>The Heroes' stupid mistake 
sent us back in time.</i>

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:15.480
Pardon us.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.310
Later, Mao-chan-sensei.

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:18.750
See you tomorrow.

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:21.760
What's the matter, Mao-sensei?

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:27.130
<i>If they appear before me in that same 
state again once I'm the Demon Lord,</i>

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:30.130
<i>will history repeat itself?</i>

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:33.290
<i>Will I be swept away by them all over again?</i>

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:35.780
<i>If that's how it'll be, then...</i>

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:39.770
<i>Yeah! No more Demon Lord for me!</i>

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:42.300
How about a drink on the way home?

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.150
Sounds good. I'll join you.

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:48.070
Yeah! Today we drink!

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:50.350
A toast to an ordinary life!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:57.170
Now we just need to wait
for a Demon Lord to show up!

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:00.420
I hope one will show up soon!

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:04.920
Roll 2

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.880
Quest Practical!

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:38.180
"Quest Practical!"
